flowchart TD

    Dev[Git Push] --> CI[CI Pipeline]

    CI -->|Create Base or Delta| Artifact[Versioned Artifacts]
    Artifact -->|Upload| FB1[FlashBlade Primary Region]

    FB1 -->|Native Async Replication| FB2[FlashBlade Secondary Region]

    subgraph Region A
        FB1 --> A1[Node Group A1]
        FB1 --> A2[Node Group A2]
    end

    subgraph Region B
        FB2 --> B1[Node Group B1]
        FB2 --> B2[Node Group B2]
    end

    A1 -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchA[Atomic Symlink Switch]
    A2 -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchA
    B1 -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchB[Atomic Symlink Switch]
    B2 -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchB
